  "notes": [
    "ESTOP_SENSE reads the E-stop's second NC contact (closed to GND = released; open or broken wire = pressed) through a 10k pull-up and 1k/100n filter, edge-latched in an interrupt (R6)",
    "Encoders: channel A only on all four motors (one PCNT unit each); direction comes from the command (R4 rear stall detection)",
    "M3: PCA9685 /OE (SERVO_OE, GPIO39) is pulled up, so all eight servo PWM outputs are off through ESP32 reset and boot; firmware drives it Low only while ACT_EN is High"
  ],
